Dear Danial and hello Emily,

I was also wondering about that: a response of only ones does not leave much room to model any variation.

But perhaps what you need is some point process model ? So that you model the frequency in space with which a kill event occurs ? As a function of spatial and potentially also temporal covariates ?

Best regards  --  Marc

From: hmec...@googlegroups.com [hmec...@googlegroups.com] on behalf of Emily Weiser [emily.l...@gmail.com]
